From 5e89f86cdf45d9d9247cc4e574ad1788ec955a42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:41:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(studio): phone-first add-video flow, bottom tab bar, and
 live style preview on your footage

- Add video from phone gallery, camera capture, or desktop drag-and-drop (device-aware empty state)
- Auto-caption now opens the video picker when no clip is loaded; pasted .srt text is accepted
- Bottom tab bar on phones; tab content scrolls into view; stage capped to ~half the viewport
- Style preview strip is sticky on small screens and renders on the real video frame
- Tap/hover copy adapts to the input device; 44px touch targets, larger slider thumbs, 12px min helper text
- Remove step numbering from tabs and headings; theme text selection and caret from the palette
